SUMMARY:Fletcher Park \; A Walk in the Park 
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**A WALK IN THE PARK\,**\n**THIS WEEK: *BIL
 L MOORE COMMUNITY PARK (AKA FLETCHER PARK):***\nFletcher Community Park is
  recognized as one of the best family parks in Western North Carolina. Par
 k patrons have access to scenic walking trails\, Cane Creek\, and countles
 s other amenities.\nDifficulty: easy\, peasy. In & Out natural packed surf
 ace.\nSuitable for beginners? yes\n**Due to recent events\, Ouija boards a
 re no longer permitted.**\nWe are the **Sloth Walking Team**: “A casual 
 pace.”\nUp to 12 ppl are welcome to join us.\n**https://biggeekdad.com/2
 015/11/nature-rx/**\nLength: 2 mi\; Total ascent: 0.0 ft\n**Return Not ear
 lier than: 11:30 am**\n**Optional:** Lunch somewhere???\nThis is a dog-par
 ticipant walk. This event is NOT for those who are uncomfortable with the 
 antics of fun-loving dogs. 'On leash' rules apply.\nWeather Check: Fletche
 r\, NC\nAll walks are at your own risk. You are responsible for your OWN s
 afety and adequate equipment.\nWaiver: : The organizer of this event is a 
 volunteer and not a professional guide. The function of the organizer is o
 nly to organize this event. There are certain risks inherent in any outdoo
 r activity. Each participant\, by signing up to attend this event\, agrees
  to release from liability the leader(s)\, Hendo Fun Friends\, its Partner
 s\, Affiliates\, and members for any accident\, injury\, illness\, or pers
 onal loss which might occur while participating in this activity or while 
 traveling in any vehicle during this trip. Each participant further agrees
  to abide by the rules and regulations concerning safety\, to follow instr
 uctions of the leader(s)\, and not to become intentionally separated from 
 the group. The leader(s) also has the right to use any images collected on
  this trip for recording on website photo collections.\ngordie's contact: 
 CurmudgeonHiker@gmail.com\n(**before** day of hike): 828.393.0297 (text on
 ly)\n**Pics: https://www.flickr.com/photos/146993931@N05/albums**
