SUMMARY:Celebrating America's 250th with Folk Music by Tom Fisch
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nFrom *Yankee Doodle* to *Oh Susannah*\, to 
 *Blowin’ In The Wind* and *Take Me Home Country Roads*\, folk music has 
 been a part of the fabric of America for 250 years. Join Tom Fisch as he p
 erforms some of our country’s most celebrated folk songs. It’ll be a s
 ing-along good time!\n\nNo registration required.\n\n*This free program is
  funded by the Friends of the Library.*
