SUMMARY:A Walk in the Park\; Art on Main
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**A Walk in the Park\;**\nWe will Tour de P
 arks of the area. One at a time.\n**This Week: *Art on Main Festival:***\n
 The Art on Main Fine Art and Craft Show is back\, and it’s celebrating i
 ts 68th year. For over six decades\, this event has been a highlight in th
 e art community\, drawing in art enthusiasts from all over.\nAll mediums o
 f fine art and fine craft\n[https://www.acofhc.org/art-on-main-2026.html](
 https://www.acofhc.org/art-on-main-2026.html)\n**I will be Meeting near th
 e bear near Mike’s on Main at 10:30a…**\nLength: 6-10 blocks\nApprx re
 turn time: 12 noon\n**Optional:** Lunch nearby somewhere..\nWeather Check:
  Hendersonville\nBest leave Fluffy at home….\ngordie's contact: curmudge
 onhiker@gmail.com\n(**before** day of walk): 828.393.0297 (talk & text)\n*
 *Pics: https://www.flickr.com/photos/146993931@N05/albums**
